    Written for this project.

rtl/soc/top/tinyriscv_soc_top.sv -- the example DUT's top level
    Copyright 2020 Blue Liang, Apache-2.0, modified for this project: the
    `scan_gate` freeze input was added to the port list, and uart0 was
    swapped for scan_uart_top. Those two changes ARE the DUT-side contract
