    Both copyrights apply.

rtl/soc/core/tracer.sv
    Copyright 2020 Blue Liang, Apache-2.0. Unmodified except for an
    `ifndef SYNTHESIS guard: the module is simulation-only and its
    `string` variables are not synthesisable, but `analyze -autoread`
